{"id":33,"titleZh":"管弦乐团的声音","titleEn":"The Sound of an Orchestra","date":"1965-12-14","dateZh":"1965 年 12 月 14 日","concepts":"作曲家风格高于乐团个性、揉弦与把位控制、节奏微差","thesis":"一支伟大的乐团不该靠一成不变的招牌音色炫耀自己——它必须彻底隐身，吹莫扎特就回到轻盈古典，吹德彪西则变得纤细清透。","plain":"很多人喜欢称赞名团自带辨识度极高的音色，伯恩斯坦反倒警告这其实很危险：如果用同一种肥厚音色拉遍天下，所有作曲家就都会被磨平棱角。演奏家必须随时调整揉弦幅度、弓压、编制规模以及美国爵士需要的微小节奏摇摆。","scenes":["开场故意用 67 把弦乐配合浓郁揉弦与滑音拉一段海顿慢板，观众正陶醉，伯恩斯坦当众泼冷水“这是绝对不该这么拉的海顿”；随即示范零揉弦对照，甚至现场挥手“请走”一半弦乐与管乐退回古典编制再重拉。","让七位声部首席现场同台表演“瞬间换音色”：刚用清冷瘦削的法式质感吹完德彪西《伊比利亚》，伯恩斯坦一抬手立刻切换回浓稠温暖的勃拉姆斯《第一交响曲》音色；最后再对比机械均等的巴赫节奏与带自由摇摆的美式科普兰《牛仔竞技》。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1JQ4y1M7sz","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JQ4y1M7sz","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 管弦乐团之声","duration":"53:45","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/sound-of-an-orchestra","repertoire":[{"composer":"Haydn","piece":"Symphony No. 88 in G Major","titleZh":"第 88 交响曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/1b/53/89/1b538964-d0b1-e5a3-4ed6-09cc6bc2792e/mzaf_17100041259062431938.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/symphony-no-88-in-g-major-finale-allegro-con-spirito/284727847?i=284727851&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Vienna Philharmonic & Karl Münchinger","recordingTrack":"Symphony No. 88 In G Major: Finale Allegro Con Spirito","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Haydn%20Symphony%20No.%2088%20in%20G%20Major+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Haydn%20Symphony%20No.%2088%20in%20G%20Major"},{"composer":"Beethoven","piece":"Symphony No. 5 in C Minor, Op. 67","titleZh":"第五交响曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/52/93/02/52930254-6025-c7d2-92cb-44f34e24c22d/mzaf_2193174951270121243.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/symphony-no-5-in-c-minor-op-67-orch-by-gustav-mahler/1743941872?i=1743941874&uo=4","recor